"""Hold the figures of thesis v4's Chapter 6 (the corrected design) to their result files.

thesis_rerun_figures.py covers the figures the thesis had before v4. This covers the chapter added in
v4 and the results sections it includes. Each entry is a piece of the text with ⟨⟩ where a figure
sits, the result file and key the figure comes from, and how it is printed. The text with the
current value filled in must occur exactly once in the two chapter files; otherwise the entry is
reported. Nothing is rewritten.

    python thesis_v4_chapter6_check.py
"""
import json, sys
from pathlib import Path

